  "name": "Twice-Baked Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "Crisp-topped potatoes with a savory creamy filling",
  "description": "Baked potatoes are scooped, combined with sautéed vegetables, seasonings, sour cream, bacon, and Cheddar, then returned to the oven until the topping melts.",
